  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many mini-games in the Android version have a huge number of problems, and some are practically unplayable. For example, I can cite the world:\n\n1. A Simple Fishing World\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_ab93c6a0-d158-4e07-88fe-f8f222018faa\n\nThere is a button overlapping issue in the world that makes it very difficult to sit on the floor.\n\n2. VRCRAFT\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_01b62965-1b3c-4062-bc22-0b339b8063ca\n\nWhen changing the DPI scale, the control buttons become enormously enlarged, making it very difficult to play.\n\n3. NEOWORLDS\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_544e7879-d870-42a2-9c7a-99eb95a8e62f\n\nI can walk around the worlds, but I can't interact with any objects or fully play the game at all.\n\n4. TRASH COMPACTOR.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_97a05df7-86de-4bf4-bd26-24dacedd50ce\n\nIf you select \"Aim with a crosshair\" in the controls, this game becomes extremely unplayable if you are the one throwing garbage at other players.\n\nI can also mention Billiards, which I have never been able to play on a mobile device, because it is not optimized at all.\n\nThere are many other worlds with minigames that are completely unplayable, but these are some of the few I can think of. Device: Samsung Galaxy A34 5G, 6GB RAM, One UI 8, Android 16. But this applies to all device models.",
